  m_text: "<b>1. Acceptance of Terms</b>\nBy downloading, accessing, or using the
    MuseoAR mobile application (the \u201CApp\u201D), you agree to be bound by these
    Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the
    App.\n\n<b>2. Description of the Service</b>\nMuseoAR is an augmented reality
    (AR) mobile application designed to enhance the museum experience by providing
    interactive, multilingual information on artifacts and exhibits. The App is for
    informational and educational purposes only.\n\n<b>3. User Obligations</b>\nYou
    agree to use the App in accordance with all applicable laws and regulations.\n\nYou
    shall not misuse the App in any way that may harm its functionality or access
    rights for other users\n\n<b>4. Intellectual Property Rights</b>\nAll content
    available within the App, including but not limited to text, graphics, images,
    software, and multimedia, is the intellectual property of MuseoAR or its licensors.\n\nYou
    are not permitted to modify, distribute, reproduce, or use any of the content
    for commercial purposes without prior written consent.\n\n<b>5. Privacy and Data
    Collection</b>\nThe App may collect data such as language preferences, scan history,
    and device information for the purpose of enhancing user experience. For detailed
    information, refer to our Privacy Policy.\n\nWe are committed to protecting your
    personal information and ensuring it is used responsibly.\n\n<b>6. Limitations
    of Liability</b>\nMuseoAR and its developers shall not be liable for any direct,
    indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages resulting from the use
    or inability to use the App.\n\nThe App may include links to third-party websites
    for additional resources. MuseoAR is not responsible for the content or availability
    of these external sites.\n\n<b>7. Updates and Modifications</b>\nWe may update
    or modify the App and these Terms and Conditions at any time without prior notice.
    By continuing to use the App after changes are posted, you accept those changes.\n\nWe
    recommend checking this page periodically for updates.\n\n<b>8. Termination of
    Access</b>\nMuseoAR reserves the right to terminate or suspend your access to
    the App without notice for any violation of these Terms.\n\nUpon termination,
    all rights granted to you under these Terms will cease immediately.\n\n<b>9.
    Governing Law</b>\nThese Terms and Conditions are governed by and construed in
    accordance with the laws of Philippines, without regard to its conflict of laws
    principles.\n\n<b>10. Contact Information</b>\nFor any questions or concerns
    regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at: Email: museoar2024@gmail.com
    Address: STI Academic Center, Alabang-Zapote Road, corner V.Guinto, Las Pi\xF1as,
    1740 Metro Manila.\n\n<b>11. Disclaimers</b>\nThe App is provided on an \"as
    is\" basis without any warranties, express or implied.\n\nMuseoAR does not guarantee
    that the App will be error-free or uninterrupted.\n\n<b>12. User Acknowledgement</b>\nBy
    using the App, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be
    bound by these Terms and Conditions."
